WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:09.550
I have some childhood memories of
my parents bringing me to the zoo.

2
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.350
I was little, I don't know,
somewhere between seven and ten.

3
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:20.950
I love wild animals, and
today, on this lovely Sunday

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.750
afternoon, I decided to come back
and relive a bit of my childhood,

5
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.765
so I've popped in for a little visit.

6
00:00:31.815 --> 00:00:33.150
It's really nice.

7
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.850
I'd encourage as many people as
possible to get out of the house

8
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:43.350
before winter sets in, and come and see

9
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:48.950
which wild animals are
still here at the zoo.

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.926
From what I remember, there were
elephants, tigers, a giraffe.

11
00:00:54.976 --> 00:00:56.950
It was really lovely.

12
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.550
Improvements… I don't know, it probably
takes a big investment to bring

13
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:10.350
wild animals to this zoo, but
maybe a little miracle will happen.

